{"seq":2,"slug":"webgl-basics","title":"WebGL 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-and-web-api/media-and-graphics/webgl-basics","wordCount":532,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"webgl-基础\">WebGL 基础</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>WebGL 是基于 OpenGL ES 的浏览器 3D API，让 JavaScript 直接驱动 GPU。它的渲染管线由 <strong>顶点着色器 → 光栅化 → 片段着色器</strong> 三段核心构成，着色器用 GLSL 编写并在 GPU 上执行；<strong>Buffer</strong> 存顶点数据、<strong>Texture</strong> 存图像、<strong>Uniform</strong> 传全局参数。Three.js 在此基础上提供高层抽象，WebGPU 则是支持计算着色器的下一代方案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"什么是-webgl\">什么是 WebGL</h2><p><strong>WebGL（Web Graphics Library）</strong> 是基于 OpenGL ES 的浏览器 3D 图形 API。它允许 JavaScript 直接与 GPU 通信，执行顶点处理和片段着色，实现高性能的 2D/3D 图形渲染。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    JS[&quot;JavaScript&quot;] --&gt; WebGL[&quot;WebGL API&quot;]&#10;    WebGL --&gt; Vertex[&quot;顶点着色器\\n(GPU)&quot;]&#10;    Vertex --&gt; Rasterize[&quot;光栅化&quot;]&#10;    Rasterize --&gt; Fragment[&quot;片段着色器\\n(GPU)&quot;]&#10;    Fragment --&gt; Framebuffer[&quot;帧缓冲&quot;]&#10;    Framebuffer --&gt; Screen[&quot;屏幕显示&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    JS[\"JavaScript\"] --&gt; WebGL[\"WebGL API\"]\n    WebGL --&gt; Vertex[\"顶点着色器\\n(GPU)\"]\n    Vertex --&gt; Rasterize[\"光栅化\"]\n    Rasterize --&gt; Fragment[\"片段着色器\\n(GPU)\"]\n    Fragment --&gt; Framebuffer[\"帧缓冲\"]\n    Framebuffer --&gt; Screen[\"屏幕显示\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"shader-管线\">Shader 管线</h2><p>WebGL 使用 <strong>GLSL（OpenGL Shading Language）</strong> 编写着色器程序，运行在 GPU 上。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const vertexShaderSource = `&#10;  attribute vec4 a_position;&#10;  attribute vec4 a_color;&#10;  varying vec4 v_color;&#10;  uniform mat4 u_matrix;&#10;&#10;  void main() {&#10;    gl_Position = u_matrix * a_position;&#10;    v_color = a_color;&#10;  }&#10;`;&#10;&#10;const fragmentShaderSource = `&#10;  precision mediump float;&#10;  varying vec4 v_color;&#10;&#10;  void main() {&#10;    gl_FragColor = v_color;&#10;  }&#10;`;&#10;&#10;function createShader(gl: WebGLRenderingContext, type: number, source: string): WebGLShader {&#10;  const shader = gl.createShader(type)!;&#10;  gl.shaderSource(shader, source);&#10;  gl.compileShader(shader);&#10;&#10;  if (!gl.getShaderParameter(shader, gl.COMPILE_STATUS)) {&#10;    const log = gl.getShaderInfoLog(shader);&#10;    gl.deleteShader(shader);&#10;    throw new Error(`Shader compilation failed: ${log}`);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return shader;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function createProgram(&#10;  gl: WebGLRenderingContext,&#10;  vertexShader: WebGLShader,&#10;  fragmentShader: WebGLShader,&#10;): WebGLProgram {&#10;  const program = gl.createProgram()!;&#10;  gl.attachShader(program, vertexShader);&#10;  gl.attachShader(program, fragmentShader);&#10;  gl.linkProgram(program);&#10;&#10;  if (!gl.getProgramParameter(program, gl.LINK_STATUS)) {&#10;    const log = gl.getProgramInfoLog(program);&#10;    gl.deleteProgram(program);&#10;    throw new Error(`Program linking failed: ${log}`);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return program;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> vertexShaderSource</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  attribute vec4 a_position;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  attribute vec4 a_color;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  varying vec4 v_color;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  uniform mat4 u_matrix;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  void main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    gl_Position = u_matrix * a_position;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    v_color = a_color;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> fragmentShaderSource</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  precision mediump float;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  varying vec4 v_color;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  void main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    gl_FragColor = v_color;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createShader</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">gl</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=